          "tree_id": "522087004f9f144a90added8589eb8755cf260a4",
          "message": "fix(github-projects): refuse a malformed command line or idle period in the schema check\n\nvalidate.mjs read any command line that was not `--serve` as its standard-input\nmode, and any idle period it could not read as the default. It now refuses\nboth, answering `internal` and exiting non-zero: the command line must be one of\nthe two shapes its usage names, and GITHUB_SCHEMA_IDLE_MS a whole number of\nmilliseconds from 1 to 2^31-1, a timer's range. A test drives six malformed\ncommand lines and seven malformed idle periods through bun; against the\nprevious file it fails on the first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-01T10:08:25Z",
